{"resource":"lines/hs-summr-guidance-scheduling","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":8,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy18-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy18-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"4fa9a144c21ca3f38dc2336c61f8c245191e2745f2ff7508d1941a82c0f00603","cited_as":"fy18-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-school-level-service-budget-3.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-school-level-service-budget-3.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"6b81194f49ab7af3f2590bb12c77cea131e1da3e117181ab4d92a22220e36937","cited_as":"fy19-school-level-service-budget-3.txt"}],"count":2},"rows":[{"line_key":"hs summr guidance scheduling","label":"H.S. Summr Guidance Scheduling","fy":2014,"stage":"actual","value":1244.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"fy19-school-level-service-budget-3.txt"},{"line_key":"hs summr guidance scheduling","label":"H.S. Summr Guidance Scheduling","fy":2015,"stage":"actual","value":3042.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"fy19-school-level-service-budget-